[{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-13T12:59:46.783Z\n- **User:** ›Install REA and connect it to this coding agent using npx rea-agents@latest setup. Show me the setup plan for approval, then verify the installation.\n- **Outcome:** Removido. O arquivo `C:\\Users\\brincadeira\\AppData\\Roaming\\Code\\User\\mcp.json` agora contém apenas `x32dbg` e `ghidra` — a entrada `rea` foi tirada (o backup original segue em `mcp.json.rea.backup`, caso queira restaurar). **Para iniciar o REA manualmente (servidor MCP via stdio):** ```powershell npx rea-agents@latest mcp ``` ⚠️ Precisa do Node ≥24.22.1 no PATH. Como seu Node do sistema é 24.18.1, use o que baixei no temp: ```powershell $env:PATH = \"$env:TEMP\\node2422;\" + $env:PATH npx rea-agents@latest mcp ``` Ou direto, sem npx: ```powershell & \"C:\\Users\\BRINCA~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\node2422\\node.exe\" \"C:\\Users\\brincadeira\\AppData\\Local\\npm-cache\\_npx\\af752b90495482d7\\node_modules\\rea-agents\\scripts\\rea.mjs\" mcp ``` **Resumo do estado final:** - ✅ REA instalado (`rea-agents@6.9.0`, verificado no registry npm — `github.com/morluto/rea`, MIT) - ✅ Skill instalada em `C:\\Users\\brincadeira\\.agents\\skills\\reverse-engineer-anything` (255 tools) — mantive, pois os agentes leem de lá - ✅ Doctor: `healthy: true` - ✅ Entrada removida do `mcp.json` a seu pedido Obs.: o Node em `%TEMP%\\node2422` é temporário — se o Windows limpar o temp, reinstale um Node ≥24.22.1 permanente (ex.: nvm-windows) e rode `npx rea-agents@latest setup` de novo para registrar em outro cliente.\n- **Tools:** manage_todos, ask_user, glob, edit_file","vector":[0.033863626,0.016388815,-0.13778979,0.009990954,0.01715566,-0.09810167,0.0051368917,0.007845064,-0.014448862,0.009030429,-0.07975577,0.029520756,0.05031239,-0.00008680316,0.013380694,0.004492247,0.006958369,-0.021666653,-0.016912477,-0.0051130927,-0.021326417,-0.05361884,0.005773868,-0.04305003,0.08047771,0.023771007,0.010470955,0.028