ded `txtHitCount` (TextBox) and `label5` (\"Hits\") to `groupBox5` (below Delay). Default value \"1\" matches `AttackService.HitCount`.\n\n### Injection Architecture\n*   **Method:** DLL Side-Loading via `opengl32.dll` proxy in `F:\\blackrockmu\\` (not `CreateRemoteThread`).\n*   **Flow:**\n    1.  Game loads local `opengl32.dll` (proxy).\n    2.  Proxy `DllMain` loads `byp.dll`.\n    3.  Proxy forwards GL calls to System32 `opengl32.dll`.\n*   **byp.dll Role:** Hooks `ws2_32` (`send`/`recv`/`connect`), redirects to `127.0.0.1`, connects to MuProxy2.\n    *   **Port 44412:** Commands (`ATTACK_START`, etc.).\n    *   **Port 44413:** Data/Packets.\n*   **MuProxy2 Side:**\n    *   `HookListenerService` listens on 44412/44413.\n    *   `MuProxy2.Hook.dll` (C++ x86) hooks IAT (`send`/`recv`/`WSASend`/`WSARecv`).\n    *   Captures packets to named pipe `\\\\.\\pipe\\MuProxy2` (format: `PKT SEND/RECV <hex>`).\n\n### Open Threads & Debugging\n*   **Runtime Issue:** Latest log shows `0xC0000135` (STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND). `byp.dll` failed to load despite proxy presence. Likely missing dependency (e.g., `msvcr100.dll`) or file removal.\n*   **Legacy Code:** `btnLaunch_Click` starts process normally (flags=0). Original injection logic absent; attachment occurs automatically via side-loading.\n*   **PS Bypass Context:** PS.dll hooks `GetStartupInfoA`. Our code intercepts this to neutralize PS and remove hooks.","vector":[0.04233687,0.0042742793,-0.13126208,-0.0054039992,0.040440403,-0.09305671,0.05861933,0.018826585,0.014029404,-0.039221834,-0.037336603,0.0443096,0.056402426,-0.022808509,0.013519049,-0.024246758,-0.007562796,-0.025956808,-0.024286255,-0.026833253,-0.011874193,-0.055272255,0.004429536,-0.06252806,0.10497766,0.059193507,0.036477573,0.011986336,-0.053287935,-0.029746376,0.077383645,-0.040174816,-0.016933072,-0.040378887,-0.0025972917,-0.031956363,0.05376714,0.043280493,-0.06121358,-0.008440553,0.024851048,-0.037265968,0.0011041415,-0.044921335,0.022971526,0.035293832