rva seleção atual 4. **`SkillNames`** (novo): Dicionário extensível `Dictionary<ushort, string>` para mapear ID → nome. Basta adicionar: ```csharp [0x032F] = \"Concentration\", [0x0357] = \"Bless\", ``` 5. **`GetSkillName`**: Retorna o nome do dicionário ou fallback `\"Skill 0xXXXX (LvY)\"` 6. **`UpdateSkillCombo`** removido (código morto — era o replace-all antigo) ## Para personalizar os nomes: Edite o dicionário `SkillNames` no topo da seção Skills em `MainForm.cs` e adicione os IDs das suas 2 skills com os nomes reais. O combo vai exibir o nome em vez do hex. O exe está em: `F:\\blackrockmu\\psdisabled\\MuProxy2\\MuProxy2\\bin\\Release\\net8.0-windows\\MuProxy2.exe`\n- **Tools:** search_files, glob, edit_file, run_command, read_file","vector":[0.03196999,0.00987071,-0.163366,-0.010862247,0.045812167,-0.04701528,0.05223619,-0.00937991,-0.06658167,-0.05142494,-0.109189555,0.010120468,0.08190822,0.004212448,0.015002396,0.022578243,-0.016646765,-0.06481568,-0.03879379,0.0416479,-0.004757533,-0.034393,0.005414909,-0.0031150754,0.048661362,0.02045592,0.0023985906,0.032667406,-0.0544001,-0.02094875,-0.0066913613,0.021343924,0.03145144,-0.025260024,0.019399865,-0.04678084,0.06576208,-0.0072397683,-0.014774284,-0.031701945,0.018547695,-0.02390426,-0.016810922,0.0058688475,0.040193796,0.012407207,0.017365718,-0.004468656,0.07926392,-0.10136196,0.07302025,-0.00062779855,0.007106302,-0.029487977,0.08259772,0.04037096,-0.053009905,0.01119354,0.0113994265,-0.03947466,0.08447829,0.015053767,-0.046593502,0.0763047,-0.0118477065,-0.02710924,-0.0240325,0.04212354,-0.015234221,-0.015202341,0.0306618,-0.003425273,0.019013025,-0.003072385,-0.014221588,-0.01197122,-0.07252435,0.007728402,-0.01300221,0.014823736,0.001641322,0.011715033,0.07770148,-0.023582388,0.030692942,-0.017708465,-0.04513907,-0.012183902,-0.062061664,0.05511556,-0.002945232,-0.019362278,0.0080280015,0.021230482,-0.06594713,0.04509689,-0.036418978,0.023455633,-0.03335158,-0.041845135,-0.052760422,-0.030612431,0.040