7,0.021581193,-0.0014613103,0.002484431,-0.037494387,-0.033108298,-0.09721846,0.011055885,0.03785653,-0.0006669265,0.026705604,0.031302992,0.008223405,0.024092726,0.0024278853,-0.0484453,-0.004450858,0.008642185,0.0007958674,0.024664372,0.045991946,0.019337835,-0.035525262,-0.020305904,-0.023606904,-0.015417525,-0.02901554,-0.029324817,-0.038016994,0.013985507,-0.062346127,-0.00078665605,-0.010058066,-0.040023297,-0.011962503,-0.007273454,0.06321085,-0.021190949,0.03074562,-0.017803686,0.028631045,-0.04144604,-0.0007286703,-0.026049174,-0.015477071,-0.03373902,-0.035872698,-0.006313014,-0.024874145,-0.03548495,0.038859535,0.009475149,0.03062204,0.01522415,-0.055353068,-0.0030848614,0.02696185,0.03360744,0.007192664,-0.041557174,0.0084456485,0.0032591047,-0.0139112435,-0.0198166,-0.022509579,0.031176371,-0.015568193,0.0010874558,-0.045503285,-0.0222059,0.094082765,0.039921433,-0.015215308,-0.031171933,0.010792348,-0.05516476,-0.0048045446,-0.055293985,0.040687814,0.022285892,0.04092684,0.02505771,-0.02903052,-0.049177896,0.0024267707,-0.017421862,-0.010117432,0.016219856,-0.026431164,-0.03250219,0.024848182,-0.0022094843,0.028444404,0.0068079727,0.019132098,0.12010932,0.02147259,-0.016835874,-0.05166394,0.030154329,0.010398094,-0.024840508,-0.03117999,0.0018665039,0.032156322],"hash":"cfc5aee5:1428","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Summary: Mu Online Client RE & Injection (2026-11-14)\n\n**Context**\nReverse-engineering Mu Online client at `F:\\blackrockmu\\` to inject `C1 07 11` (Attack) packets via DLL side-loading (`byp.dll`).\n\n**Key Changes & Fixes**\n*   **Packet Encoding:** `D0/D1` fields use pure entity index (XOR removed); `D2` verified as constant `0x78`.\n*   **Range Logic:** Removed \"spray ±1\" in `AttackModule.cpp`; filtering relies on Watcher updating `g_MonsterMap` within `g_SessionRange`.\n*   **Skill Parser (`MainForm.cs`):**\n    *   Fixed off-by-one in `SkillMap.cpp` (`entryStart` skips ListType byte).\n    *   Filter changed from `F3 E5` to `F3 11` to reduce noise.\n    *   **Critical:** Corrected level decoding. `F3 11` entries are 4-byte: `[slot] [m_index LE] [level_encoded]`.\n    *   Formula: `real_level = level_encoded >> 3` (previously read raw byte).\n    *   Implemented `SkillNames` dictionary for labels.\n*   **Encryption:** Two-layer encryption for attack packets: Layer 1 (`wire = (plain + 0x07) ^ 0x36`) and Layer 2 (`XorData` on bytes `[3, 7)`).\n*   **Build/Deploy:** Fixed `build.bat` silent failures (replaced `timeout` with `ping -n 3`, removed `>nul` to expose locks).\n\n**Architecture & Paths**\n*   **Injection:** `opengl32.dll` proxy loads `byp.dll`, redirecting to `127.0.0.1` (Ports 44412/44413).\n*   **Capture:** `HookListenerService` outputs hex via `\\\\.\\pipe\\MuProxy2`.\n*   **Dependencies:** `PS.dll` stub for `wzAudioPlay`; PluginXdbg32 at `F:\\PluginXdbg32\\build32\\Release\\McpXdbg32.dp32`.\n*   **Project Root:** `F:\\blackrockmu\\psdisabled\\MuProxy2\\MuProxy2\\`.\n*   **Output:** `dist\\byp.dll` (~69KB) and `bin\\Release\\net8.0-windows\\MuProxy2.exe`.\n\n**Current State**\n*   Build successful. Manual copy of `byp.dll` to `F:\\blackrockmu\\byp.dll` verified.\n*   Native debugging armed with conditional breakpoint on `ws2_32:send`.\n\n**Open Blockers**\n*   **DLL Load Failure:** `byp.dll` fails with `0xC0000135` (STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND); suspect missing `msvcr100.dll` or corruption.\n*   **Node Version:** REA Agent requires Node ≥24.22.1 (system has 24.18.1); temp instance at `C:\\Users\\BRINCA~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\node2422`.\n*   **Next Step:** Manually attack monster to capture native call stack for analysis.","vector":[0.036761027,0.02294105,-0.15244341,-0.039614487,0.0654203,-0.058817368,0.026280709,0.056750283,-0.03463769,-0.035908133,-0.046704452,0.08521679,0.025181875,-0.05672132,-0.0035353305,-0.045924455,0.0010371143,-0.059158303,-0.039287247,-0.012057465,-0.01820353,-0.0450