916986,0.0034455387,0.036930308,-0.005863969,-0.029303623,0.0006804714,0.023581909,-0.03107955,0.01210899,-0.014861943,0.022876343,-0.02320522,-0.027580516,-0.019708565,-0.010125924,-0.027322548,-0.023033332,-0.04254872,0.010318407,-0.048270557,0.009268207,0.018152975,0.00022821566,0.014259158,-0.029161138,-0.011904182,-0.0024450184,-0.0053471345,0.008099332,-0.07387067,-0.010289284,0.03472566,0.00897373,-0.05893953,0.0024965985,0.013390497,0.0020341785,0.030737437,-0.013221323,-0.0118024545,0.02049172,0.025706895,0.01416279,-0.010995824,0.0052189287,-0.02833126,-0.027772786,-0.051720537,0.040293187,-0.0444557,0.013773874,-0.0071032853,-0.0039470242,-0.006131362,0.0007010651,-0.021941388,-0.023854725,0.054547407,-0.016918365,-0.00625245,0.004239139,-0.02511892,-0.0042808014,0.005940298,0.020947607,0.10055248,0.008703954,0.017326184,-0.011056191,0.028639492,0.010839172,-0.012728147,-0.046242505,-0.01018771,0.0026217727],"hash":"209086e2:1313","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-14T13:59:50.774Z\n- **User:** logs de uso da skill force. [2026-11-14 05:11:50] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND C1 8 bytes [C1 08 F3 FC E5 C6 03 A0 ] [2026-11-14 05:11:50] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND stack: Main.dll+0xBB3DE main.exe+0x5153 Main.dll+0x1464BC Main.dll+0x74D36 KERNEL32.DLL+0x1FCC9 ntdll.dll+0x682AE ntdll.dll+0x6827E [2026-11-14 05:11:50] [PACKETSNIFFER] CONNECT to 145.239.149.84:44411 [2026-11-14 05:11:50] [PACKETSNIFFER] recv() ret=4 socket=1696 [2026-11-14 05:11:50] [PACKETSNIFFER] recv() ret=41 socket=1696 [2026-11-14 05:11:5…\n- **Outcome:** O alvo da skill é `0x310F` (`OFF_INDEX`), enquanto o monstro que o servidor reporta nos `RECV` é `0x02E8` (`OFF_ID`). São **dois campos diferentes do mesmo objeto** (índice client-side vs. ID server-side) — por isso os valores divergem. Se o monstro `0x02E8` está morrendo a cada cast, a skill está acertando o alvo certo. ## Resumo Tudo certo com a skill Force: - **Pacote correto** (`C1 07 19 E7 C3 E2 CF`), alvo e direção coerentes. - **Criptografia SM validada** (fórmula, checksum, `dk` contínuo). - **Monstros morrem** — o ataque está efetivo. - O flood `C1 06` é do jogo, não do DLL. Única limitação conhecida: o **native decrypt sempre falha** e o DLL depende do own decrypt (que funciona 100%). Se quiser, posso investigar *por que* o `smObj` nativo retorna `-1` para o C3 de skill — mas para o uso da skill Force, nada está quebrado.\n- **Tools:** list_directory, read_file, search_files, glob","vector":[0.01508136,0.03027416,-0.17746732,-0.042417094,0.05643,-0.077574395,0.046050355,0.0036544024,-0.071050055,-0.059200194,-0.09309754,0.017670795,0.05855552,-0.07095911,0.023598408,-0.014539594,-0.006043847,-0.076665476,-0.0343016,0.02486601,-0.009728203,-0.014582484,-0.023627225,-0.031092903,0.061689395,0.021539135,0.0051185093,0.019552525,-0.053048544,-0.007936736,0.029421274,0.0031167802,-0.014177525,-0.05193946,-0.014861827,0.0062073823,0.0041717067,-0.034331277,-0.028015355,0.002510838,-0.0059384257,-0.079423025,0.0029266896,-0.022814102,0.018011384,0.021130994,0.050547436,0.026323415,0.027922079,-0.09280286,0.024175642,0.030464869,-0.0051621664,-0.048288923,0.08771756,0.013355615,-0.06328271,0.0024541905,-0.0018091754,-0.025038304,0.10514369,0.01257053,-0.013218746,0.08611316,-0.013064097,0.025760358,-0.038995475,0.06527734,-0.058472235,-0.010346573,0.03810057,0.0035395392,0.038028013,0.017568672,-0.033552576,0.0088124,-0.042023577,-0.022302607,-0.023320213,-0.011335768,0.02619532,0.019401086,0.04689189,-0.05758535,0.052946262,0.007577075,-0.019155094,0.025825309,0.0011235771,0.0709001,-0.013011007,-0.011308844,0.034894083,0.0063761463,-0.054362983,0.035363,-0.017537564,0.03930293,-0.008298218,-0.023643624,-0.01521951,-0.035607193,0.039858967,-0.029991299,0.01751328,0.062793575,0.0023347638,0.006191833,-0.022235224,-0.012719519,-0.03323919,0.02742169,-0.0084678,-0.041848868,0.039630394,-0.05299949,0.0140410755,-0.01605