` são só line-ending do git no Windows — inofensivos. ## Enriquecimento — pendente sua decisão As 10 referências estão sólidas; o único gap real é o **sub-sistema de bypass do PS.dll** (só uma linha na arquitetura). Se quiser, eu crio o **`references/11-ps-bypass.md`** documentando o fluxo de neutralização (`RestoreGetStartupInfoA`, `SuspendPsThreads`, os patches de `Main.dll`, o trampoline stub e os flags `FIX_MAIN_FREE_LANGUAGE`/`RESTORE_GETSTARTUPINFO`/`SUSPEND_PS_THREADS`) e já deixo commitado nesse mesmo repo. Quer que eu adicione?\n- **Tools:** git, glob, list_directory, ask_user, manage_todos, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.057087243,0.05369429,-0.16505991,-0.039303757,0.059180297,-0.07255257,0.034500804,0.028046302,-0.06590386,-0.019123204,-0.036168873,0.012000199,0.06664993,-0.011414925,0.02463608,0.028023744,-0.006027847,-0.007904647,-0.031205146,0.020874796,0.010582478,-0.027140932,-0.03528883,-0.006106133,0.1215294,0.03446029,0.026235571,0.037355725,-0.06313897,-0.020758476,0.033932455,0.038333073,0.009615755,-0.029588124,0.008062889,-0.017951224,-0.006136019,0.01629607,-0.014152939,-0.01955863,0.04049142,-0.03814004,-0.0146698,-0.025869656,0.018462064,0.0070655206,0.05934545,0.011856596,0.07385387,-0.06768222,0.06524611,0.052849844,0.03696959,-0.056770075,0.057220094,0.0114527,-0.032113664,0.026188066,-0.020662047,-0.052743003,0.08165128,0.0012381435,0.0046670954,0.06338358,-0.022637663,-0.026714526,-0.0628597,0.029616991,-0.012570303,-0.019009829,0.022901945,0.010392597,0.031114839,0.024109975,-0.013083349,-0.0076887603,-0.09811919,-0.012808657,-0.024003444,-0.0231074,0.020703953,0.0075453804,0.086550795,0.03167788,0.020655535,0.031831086,-0.019544765,0.00077789574,-0.03961731,0.091230154,-0.0012681624,-0.063690715,0.015499954,-0.0143524865,-0.047038697,0.03363766,-0.04312875,0.02721903,-0.012525102,-0.016172556,-0.05690339,-0.034714323,0.028712431,-0.024902176,0.058841933,0.0332236,-0.013153579,0.032918066,-0.004618183,0.032036074,-0.0061578215,-