":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T00:58:15.876Z\n- **User:** preciso de ajuda com os logs da aplicacao, tem mt log poluido e desorganizado, quero um arquivo de log apenas na pasta do jogo... apenas o arquivo gg_bypass [e o suficiente. em adicional, precisamos reduzir os logs de attack, precisamos logar apenas atack com skill atack normal esta funcionando bem.\n- **Outcome:** Pronto. Resumo do que foi feito: ## 1. Arquivo único de log — `gg_bypass2.log` - **`byp/gg_bypass2/src/include/Config.h:13`** — removido `PACKET_LOG_FILENAME` (`byp_packets.log`); sobrou só `LOG_FILENAME`. - **`byp/gg_bypass2/src/include/Logger.h:9`** — `Initialize` agora recebe um único caminho. - **`byp/gg_bypass2/src/Logger.cpp`** — removido `g_PacketLogFile`; `LogPacket` e `LogPacketDual` agora escrevem no mesmo `g_LogFile`. Pacotes continuam com o mesmo formato (`hex=... dec=...`), só que no arquivo único. - **`byp/gg_bypass2/src/dllmain.cpp:102`** — `InitializeLogging` monta só um caminho. - Removi os logs antigos da pasta do jogo: `byp_packets.log` (2,8 MB) e `gg_bypass2.log` (41 MB poluído). ## 2. Logs de ataque — só skill agora Em **`byp/gg_bypass2/src/AttackModule.cpp`**, removi: - `ComputeDir` (direção de ataque normal) - `SendAttack` — log por hit + hex dump do pacote 0x11 (e as variáveis que só existiam pro log) - `SendConfiguredAttack` — log por hit (redundante: `SendSkillAttack` já loga tudo) - `Dispatcher: N monstros x M hits` — disparava a cada 800 ms, era o maior poluidor **Mantido:** todos os logs de skill (`ComputeSkillDir`, as 4 linhas de `SkillAttack` com entity/XOR/gameGlobal/dir/plain), eventos de ciclo de vida (Watcher/Dispatcher start/stop, START/STOP/CONFIG), monstro detectado/removido e os diagnósticos sob demanda (DUMP/HEXDUMP/SCANVALUE/SCANSLOT/DIRSCAN, que só rodam quando você chama pelo MuProxy2). ## Verificação - `build.bat` compilou sem erros…\n- **Tools:** skill, search_files, list_directory, read_file, manage_todos, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.0048018973,0.08084532,-0.12734266,-0.020362968,0.061648995,-0.071574725,0.06523523,0.022363251,-0.07406548,-0.033472255,-0.07062564,0.023791337,0.10047179,-0.038874302,0.024326293,-0.040206615,-0.00943206,-0.010318985,-0.070062265,-0.004570315,0.025159897,-0.033489726,0.0039410796,-0.011241821,0.08677826,0.021953361,-0.028220372,0.039667007,-0.00772206,-0.02421639,0.026523545,0.014459574,-0.03791508,-0.06342853,-0.000440634,-0.058426324,0.026024925,-0.046185147,0.004406394,-0.017114881,0.03422884,-0.03415743,0.06178723,0.0025365134,0.023974426,0.039405253,0.055980287,0.022372859,0.05950735,-0.080382444,0.026940601,0.0350289,-0.01477915,-0.06759579,0.10799433,0.05991291,-0.011268654,-0.01001778,0.023621846,-0.046327136,0.09650028,0.039277066,-0.007966217,0.051854223,-0.0018497079,-0.036659803,-0.06353882,0.010008804,-0.015409776,-0.008744037,0.038511366,-0.0112743145,0.018729148,-0.008009713,-0.001001961,-0.004501167,-0.04000309,-0.01716183,0.006371104,0.013903982,0.033391774,-0.013653936,0.10370487,-0.050012402,0.016711075,-0.024830433,-0.013887918,0.025697285,-0.05600485,0.11276314,-0.008824039,-0.03157864,0.03796577,0.0305257,-0.07124203,0.024843412,-0.06588238,-0.014003315,-0.036949515,-0.010351729,-0.04410811,-0.00754667,0.0097939195,-0.0030535574,0.0025677064,0.045130633,0.0045487965,-0.0019625176,-0.022461085,0.014466961,0.015578039,0.08089777,0.0022910342,-0.0559685,0.012602003,-0.043074444,0.050212897,-0.016393406,0.0048486926,0.06894688,-0.024542442,-0.0062838513,-0.04478243,0.031651262,0.03267799,0.034611758,-0.032789342,0.04306363,0.016826006,-0.056653053,0.02529891,-0.038141128,-0.06750441,0.07442227,0.024611609,0.018095681,-0.014997217,0.0008028968,0.034173734,-0.028810503,0.023214672,-0.00018918897,-0.008679596,-0.022432767,0.03804417,-0.046908554,0.015412959,-0.03989818,-0.04132893,0.021328324,0.02598755,-0.026401741,0.012420154,0.048248135,0.05522875,0.008670098,-0.0016827972,-0.0070096403,-0.0008