ase 1) - **Arquivo único** `gg_bypass2.log` — `Logger.cpp` continua com um só `g_LogFile` (sem `byp_packets.log`) - **Labels antigos restaurados**: `LogPacket` → `hex=<raw>`; `LogPacketDual` → `hex=<raw> dec=<decrypted>` (ordem antiga: raw primeiro, dec depois) - **`AttackModule.cpp`** — redução de logs de ataque normal continua valendo (só skill attacks logam) ## Verificação - Build via `build.bat`: **sucesso**, `byp.dll` copiado para `F:\\blackrockmu\\` - Diagnósticos: **0 erros** Agora o log volta a ter stack trace + pacote human-readable, tudo em `gg_bypass2.log`.\n- **Tools:** git, edit_file, search_files, run_command","vector":[0.074731626,0.034890324,-0.14880781,-0.055816535,0.074263394,-0.086930245,0.058514178,0.041638076,-0.06228802,-0.039243568,-0.073217906,0.042600937,0.057232883,-0.0422746,0.008402952,-0.034558315,-0.0013668827,-0.031798717,-0.06615834,0.015176115,0.038269695,-0.03249762,-0.018225793,-0.006441077,0.08129143,0.014770693,-0.009586335,0.039320607,-0.045368414,-0.042801008,0.07375091,-0.01580138,-0.036955055,-0.049925238,-0.020816205,-0.035347942,0.013728441,-0.047312003,-0.007040951,0.011262404,0.05482882,-0.02455684,0.033913065,-0.0056476975,0.0020049328,0.039566215,0.0509214,0.05936671,0.03814445,-0.09804165,0.019050786,0.028784955,-0.02421414,-0.027211288,0.06511153,0.007812184,-0.032739814,0.025309915,-0.0033691728,-0.024536833,0.10182554,0.009760474,0.0030489527,0.055121277,0.0068549938,-0.004914081,-0.06306353,0.05364684,-0.040147558,0.0016036432,0.060950365,-0.029762385,0.012936671,0.04154437,0.024930552,-0.020038374,-0.046183627,-0.040050678,-0.007611023,0.009293608,-0.016581876,-0.02644663,0.07079845,-0.004624342,0.037726752,-0.031527683,-0.0049786787,0.03076229,-0.04164614,0.08158199,-0.013951335,-0.044098657,0.06199767,0.004683201,-0.050994262,0.02364765,-0.046470076,0.007841118,-0.032489218,-0.004188331,-0.058557015,-0.026030285,0.03804,-0.053106565,0.021794498,0.034208238,0.042912647,0.024952698,-0.0050124037,-0.012019944,-0.01