09372357,-0.0028717006,-0.00086297665,-0.061646942,0.016784174,0.030700935,-0.027428329,-0.034153257,-0.00895707,-0.0020957189],"hash":"9c1f1c5c:1649","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T02:58:29.304Z\n- **User:** e o stack trace foi mantido? na real a como havia mencionado antes de cair, a gente inverteu ne, esse packetsniffer log sem stacktrace, sem dados de oq tinha na memoria, sem o dump da regiao e pobre e nao me ajuda identificar o pacote...\n- **Outcome:** Pronto. Resumo do que foi feito: ## Removido (o padrão que tava poluindo) - **`src/PacketSniffer.cpp` — `LogRaw`** (linhas ~637): tirei as chamadas `Logger::LogPacketDual`/`Logger::LogPacket` que geravam a parede de hex `[RECV] len=994 hex=... dec=...`. A reassembly + `FlushReasmBuffer` (que envia os pacotes decifrados ao MuProxy2) **continua intacta** — só o log de hex bruto sumiu. - Atualizei o comentário da função pra refletir que ela só faz reassembly + proxy agora. ## Mantido (o padrão detalhado que você quer) Tudo do `HookSend`/`HookWSASend` ficou como está: - `SEND C3 24 bytes [C3 18 E8 99 ...]` (header + hex) - `SEND stack: Main.dll+0xBB3DE ...` (stack trace via EBP) - `SEND C3 decrypt (native/own): OK/FAILED` - `SEND C3>C1 decoded: [C1 0C 0E ...] dk=01` (human-readable) - Todos os logs `[SMOD]` detalhados ## Verificação - Build via `build.bat`: **sucesso**, `byp.dll` copiado pra `F:\\blackrockmu\\` - Diagnósticos: **0 erros** --- Sobre **\"se der pra melhorar esse padrão\"** — o que ainda é bem verboso é o bloco `[SMOD] DecryptBlock #N`, que repete `Mod/Dec/Xor` + `ringBuf[0..3]` + `slot[0..3]` (com `32bit=`/`product64=`) **a cada bloco de 8 bytes**. Num pacote de 94 bytes são ~12 blocos × ~12 linhas = ~150 linhas de SMOD. Quer que eu **condensa** isso? Posso: - Logar as chaves (`Mod/Dec/Xor`) **uma vez só** por operação de decrypt (em vez de a cada bloco) - Nos blocos depois do primeiro, logar só `plaintext` + `checksum` (sem o detalhe de ring/slot/product64) Isso manté…\n- **Tools:** search_files, ask_user, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.035084162,0.05886419,-0.13388665,-0.06262488,0.056892365,-0.09761518,0.039246816,0.035776213,-0.054900367,-0.05925579,-0.11894642,0.0032369287,0.05206712,-0.031627696,0.021607764,-0.030919781,0.004890237,-0.05199305,-0.043883044,0.018639306,0.03594281,-0.0128544085,-0.029910576,-0.011007281,0.0638147,0.030205732,0.010948223,0.03890334,-0.03481306,-0.02829478,0.06954061,0.014715237,-0.05158695,-0.010287355,-0.0112935025,-0.04551187,0.013964556,-0.034596667,-0.0065160696,-0.0021578544,0.026267553,-0.056088664,0.0155241545,-0.012429579,0.022933666,0.05759358,0.03853398,0.01163176,0.06463351,-0.10844448,0.02170953,0.01337268,-0.019752275,-0.047703665,0.08160241,0.0108832605,-0.026261736,0.023354461,0.044085417,-0.04172744,0.10580407,0.013082318,-0.0018338534,0.07357141,-0.012381719,-0.011153823,-0.04716563,0.057529714,-0.024315469,-0.0031956662,0.0923026,0.0009195956,0.029898822,0.026311671,0.020053523,0.0065515456,-0.03487081,-0.029358659,0.010272017,-0.014687442,0.014920437,-0.01750166,0.09644747,-0.012802732,0.00069591723,-0.0064511215,-0.03851745,-0.008551316,-0.07681756,0.079427674,-0.011241288,-0.048184354,0.0572313,0.010202532,-0.047050912,0.030839715,-0.033000395,0.022099746,-0.039052032,-0.017264148,-0.031450313,-0.02696979,0.02832474,-0.0071552205,0.012586784,0.0431902,0.0000059091903,0.016472962,-0.015395995,-0.011151327,-0.041074466,0.030684348,-0.053721923,-0.05517979,0.06911029,-0.003611145,0.0683916,-0.037388865,-0.01360678,0.058496244,-0.03634899,-0.026168207,0.017374491,0.024562832,0.10088198,-0.00597088,-0.0050025447,0.03582051,0.04880169,-0.05702289,0.023462947,-0.0044779163,-0.054605953,0.028742485,0.0275049,0.011171638,0.026062721,-0.01113758,0.037407305,-0.009327127,0.014108081,-0.004894158,-0.0037390594,0.010634594,0.014251137,-0.04844093,0.04020131,-0.033507057,-0.034473836,0.0013366941,-0.00409960