mo passo (8 linhas) ## Correções em referências existentes - **`SKILL.md`** — linha 11 na tabela + quick fact apontando pro §11 - **`03-crypto.md`** — `NativeDecrypt` marcado como removido; own `Decrypt` é o caminho único de C3/C4 - **`07-build-deploy.md`** — log único, `byp_packets.log` removido - **`08-config.md`*…\n- **Tools:** skill, search_files, read_file, manage_todos, write_file, edit_file, todo","vector":[0.026637457,0.023982985,-0.15552607,-0.06240607,0.069773674,-0.06853735,0.06175102,-0.000022076385,-0.041377053,-0.026119199,-0.07004085,-0.0035494776,0.085402094,-0.028436847,0.020432858,-0.008738812,-0.05226794,-0.055960864,-0.053084023,0.03626753,-0.0105641605,-0.012796109,-0.03750762,-0.018465742,0.09141403,0.018316044,-0.025019165,0.063902095,-0.025825405,0.0057641817,0.045117386,-0.019149762,-0.006928234,-0.041442398,0.013313218,-0.06884026,-0.0022901534,-0.02911223,-0.018783659,-0.021286443,0.043374546,-0.02617145,0.0015125464,0.0156236505,-0.03146362,0.064460896,0.046909124,-0.008715806,0.050728597,-0.098861195,0.044227164,0.007371967,0.00481576,-0.042032868,0.15134907,0.03138441,-0.022113035,0.033230722,0.025730323,-0.031018728,0.12347438,0.0265472,-0.017259799,0.03791487,0.005548369,-0.042813227,-0.04205304,0.04396444,-0.02749818,-0.0049862876,0.06406528,-0.035698354,0.01084069,0.018000674,-0.020506328,0.004516764,-0.04039785,-0.015936237,0.0019336604,-0.0022027318,-0.017862232,0.0054171155,0.104724266,-0.005890478,0.038973138,-0.012752455,-0.024222331,0.020507399,-0.04472973,0.07462227,-0.04920667,-0.046687994,0.04397986,-0.027561704,-0.055209704,0.04354397,-0.055337377,0.021462962,-0.021859605,-0.015598241,-0.037567783,-0.038148955,0.04343096,0.0015304872,0.0123430425,0.0515313,0.017886883,-0.019551318,-0.02439555,0.0013216059,-0.015226657,0.026661774,-0.047829196,-0.027487218,0.037497632,-0.025226673,0.032060053,-0.027959514,0.014770871,0.070276156,-0.051706005,-0.029649243,-0.016073234,0.033040255,0.076206155,0.025274333,-0.015556843,0.020743