2,-0.018840423,0.025132012,-0.006490297,-0.041933276,-0.04249648,0.00996757,-0.064103045,-0.047722667,-0.04052506,-0.059747964,-0.038679086,-0.016135272,-0.06464176,-0.016707722,0.009743385,-0.018247373,-0.0031556035,-0.039881557,0.034669254,-0.0022993563,0.020504015,-0.005897946,0.057693113,-0.039311025,-0.0170497,0.0063105086,-0.019783396,-0.030868204,-0.01577943,0.03159586,-0.01198634,-0.03421168,0.038765702,-0.0029905213,0.012432478,-0.034162484,-0.05446419,0.041515674,0.02911376,0.021752091,-0.015132278,-0.04017499,0.022659734,-0.02648193,-0.06107706,0.051002882,-0.029970622,0.0062344437,0.010492326,0.00026822014,-0.013764852,-0.013884143,0.030856486,0.0044584945,-0.02605951,-0.049735844,-0.07836193,-0.0057728332,0.013641193,-0.024585633,0.00025927616,-0.011768375,0.07296356,0.02714233,0.023036268,-0.008923299,-0.0035005226,0.009915462,-0.008873254,-0.010140938,0.015621432,-0.013146938,-0.0018783658,-0.042141978,-0.009370919,0.005241323,0.055768874,0.07411904,0.033018697,-0.00022940386,-0.0041012918,0.05178607,0.007307665,-0.020695047,-0.06382713,-0.016685963,-0.055461876],"hash":"1954329f:57","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"*   **Objective:** Optimize logging, standardize decryption to `SimpleModulusCipher::Decrypt`, correct skill packet documentation, and implement a robust single-breakpoint debug protocol to prevent character disconnects (DC).\n*   **Key Decisions:**\n    *   **Single Log Architecture:** Consolidated all output to `gg_bypass2.log`; removed `byp_packets.log` and per-hit hex dumps to reduce noise.\n    *   **Decryption Standardization:** Removed `NativeDecrypt` fallback entirely to eliminate \"native failed\" noise and zeroed-key issues. C2S now uses exclusively `SimpleModulusCipher::Decrypt`.\n    *   **Skill Packet Correction:** Corrected documentation stating skill wire is 1 byte (`C3`), not 2. Byte `E7` is `MAIN_PACKET_SERIAL`, overwritten by Send before SM encryption, replacing the previous `skill_high` assumption.\n    *   **Debug Protocol:** Established a strict 1-BP rule at `0x404E34` (serial write) to prevent debugger hang-ups and character DCs. The BP is active only during cast, read immediately, and removed to keep the system clean.\n*   **File Changes:**\n    *   `src/Logger.cpp`, `src/include/Logger.h`, `src/include/Config.h`: Removed packet log references; `Initialize` now accepts a single path.\n    *   `src/PacketSniffer.cpp`: Removed `NativeDecrypt` fallback; restored `LogStackTrace` and human-readable C3/C4 decoding.\n    *   `src/SimpleModulusCipher.cpp/.h`: Removed `NativeDecrypt`; kept `NativeEncrypt` for self-tests.\n    *   `src/AttackModule.cpp`: Reduced log noise for normal attacks (0x11).\n    *   `src/PacketSniffer.cpp` (~line 1410): Added `LogPacketDual` in `InjectToServer` to capture injected packets bypassing `HookSend`.\n    *   `src/PacketSniffer.cpp` (`LogRaw`): Removed redundant `LogPacket`/`LogPacketDual` calls.\n*   **Documentation Updates:**\n    *   Created `references/11-log-analysis.md` for log format and healthy SEND C3 flow.\n    *   Updated `SKILL.md`, `03-crypto.md`, `07-build-deploy.md`, `08-config.md` for single-log architecture.\n    *   Created `byp/docs/stack_c1_07_19/` (5 files) documenting the packet stack.\n*   **Current State:**\n    *   Build successful via `build.bat` with zero errors; `byp.dll` deployed to `F:\\blackrockmu\\`.\n    *   Logging is low-noise for non-skill traffic with restored stack traces.\n    *   Debugger is active with 1 BP set at `0x404E34`, ready for user-triggered cast analysis.\n*   **Open Threads:**\n    *","vector":[0.0332801,-0.00056788104,-0.16207448,-0.07718295,0.08294338,-0.07022541,0.072451755,0.03177148,-0.009362566,-0.061476402,-0.07460577,0.04424145,0.030286636,-0.00076200446,0.025820775,-0.016925795,-0.02693291,-0.07225119,0.021389674,0.0015397329,-0.014631636,-0.06607993,-0.009668344,-0.030993868,0.089500405,0.051897235,0.0