0.05425226,-0.05091887,-0.024794072,-0.008005129,0.0007906415,0.05666869,-0.03183835,0.017969964,-0.02728848,0.033516087,-0.018114995,-0.048617475,0.045251068,-0.009427012,-0.007778205,-0.060866896,0.023581153,-0.041993044,-0.025557427,-0.06618613,0.004444628,-0.023199216,0.037395593,-0.027387377,0.005791458,-0.04280618,0.017869424,0.083384335,-0.04186827,0.008719348,-0.019642238,-0.03694078,0.016407005,0.004601347,-0.009784503,0.008923497,0.0053737713,0.10293306,-0.0063518193,0.017889557,-0.022826523,0.05667316,-0.02075611,-0.04298073,-0.012248319,-0.07762591,-0.058060195],"hash":"5051f24b:58","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Session Summary: `gg_bypass2` Optimization & Skill Protocol Debugging (2026-11-15)\n\n*   **Core Changes**\n    *   **Logging:** Consolidated all output to `gg_bypass2.log`; removed `byp_packets.log` and per-hit hex dumps. Reduced log noise for normal attacks (`0x11`).\n    *   **Crypto:** Standardized C2S decryption to `SimpleModulusCipher::Decrypt`; removed `NativeDecrypt` fallback.\n    *   **Code Refactoring:**\n        *   `src/Logger.cpp/.h`, `src/include/Config.h`: `Initialize` now accepts a single log path.\n        *   `src/PacketSniffer.cpp`: Removed `NativeDecrypt`, restored `LogStackTrace`, added `LogPacketDual` in `InjectToServer`.\n        *   `src/SimpleModulusCipher.cpp/.h`: Removed `NativeDecrypt`; retained `NativeEncrypt` for self-tests.\n    *   **Documentation:** Created `references/11-log-analysis.md` and `byp/docs/stack_c1_07_19/`. Updated `SKILL.md`, `03-crypto.md`, `07-build-deploy.md`, and `08-config.md`.\n\n*   **Key Decisions & Technical Findings**\n    *   **Skill Wire Protocol:** Confirmed skill wire is 1 byte (`C3`). `E7` is identified as `MAIN_PACKET_SERIAL` overwritten before SM encryption.\n    *   **Injection Pipeline Clarification:**\n        *   `InjectC1Attack`: Handles `0x11`/`0x19` via `XorData` + Layer-1 → **C1** wire.\n        *   `InjectSkillC1`: Handles only `0x19` via `XorData` + SM + C3 wrapper + Layer-1 → **C3 0D [11]** wire.\n    *   **Discrepancy Identified:** Capture analysis suggests the correct skill path is **C1 pure** (same as `0x11`), implying `InjectSkillC1` (SM/C3) is likely incorrect based on a previous misread of `0xE7C3`. However, `AttackModule.cpp:207` currently still calls `InjectSkillC1`.\n    *   **Debugging Protocol:** Strict 1-BP rule established at `0x404E34` with condition `([EBP-0x2116]&0xFF)==0x19` to isolate the subtype byte.\n\n*   **Current State**\n    *   Build successful (`byp/dist/byp.dll`). Deployment to `F:\\blackrockmu\\` pending manual copy (game running).\n    *   Debugger active with corrected breakpoint at `0x404E34`.\n    *   New `[SKILLHOOK]` logs prepared to validate skill ID transformation.","vector":[0.021084396,0.012900897,-0.16049607,-0.05840814,0.06291893,-0.056604967,0.09680068,0.011869551,0.000015392357,-0.038922388,-0.054136343,0.05428026,0.010511252,-0.023407884,0.045409534,-0.00717671,-0.014071867,-0.033945642,-0.017759275,0.0016109559,0.014980421,-0.07578028,0.008905154,-0.054578695,0.11127629,0.03186749,0.013897893,-0.0072514173,-0.019469583,0.0007335319,0.03822541,-0.057525236,-0.011105263,-0.0720885,-0.0604228,-0.045842584,0.037261277,-0.011544953,-0.025767874,-0.04227408,0.05680891,0.0113749765,0.018596785,-0.04150032,-0.019910885,0.016836021,0.09386747,0.027324833,0.04443411,-0.10818146,0.0010836003,0.04388845,0.013060979,-0.032693963,0.07529125,0.022488806,-0.028222315,0.027794523,0.008504495,-0.096415915,0.047104284,0.051200032,-0.01873327,0.02633277,0.011053785,-0.030371655,-0.019539267,0.074964225,-0.014720296,-0.010180014,0.008634435,-0.034540255,0.006488497,0.013726397,-0.017944256,-0.020334553,-0.026648019,-0.020846734,-0.0045211986,0.036490493,-0.022335961,0.0027026155,0.029715873,-0.034288768,0.037008166,0.0072808713,-0.04731242,0.029584376,-0.029078053,0.08184782,0.0048167757,-0.013592453,0.018245855