.02950595,-0.015155804,-0.0008755785,-0.006401901,0.03737579,-0.028981702,0.0041341353,0.041242875,-0.00006276036,-0.04520525,0.018042848,0.028233897,0.024438696,0.034661196,-0.013635657,0.015265923,0.020837005,-0.0043065418,-0.020169107,0.028879067,-0.006507509,-0.021838542,-0.03913608,-0.015128561,-0.04743052,0.059969034,-0.0027906576,-0.040396944,0.028594488,-0.06614831,-0.05780368,-0.056361236,0.07007638,0.026887449,0.06411342,-0.02171051,0.029573306,0.01893984,-0.0026453617,-0.037892845,-0.01254181,0.017474633,-0.052729663,0.038763598,0.051001266,-0.016722651,0.039063394,0.08740939,0.057085115,0.060436957,0.000775592,0.036181267,-0.03744026,0.021428647,-0.018581977,-0.044768732,-0.0151699465,0.04861279,-0.024678655,-0.038727175,-0.014199088,0.04361434,-0.01056803,0.021288102,-0.016067082,-0.06937656,-0.06910064,0.017172057,0.037510198,-0.0060177357,0.0018056973,0.08969099,-0.009090162,0.08097796,-0.0032620826,-0.047866832,0.00891488,-0.0139844855,-0.029698513,0.031220129,0.02476672,-0.026918031,-0.014740434,0.0029656882,-0.03945727,-0.02342112,-0.022973035,-0.017176952,-0.014845317,0.005523006,-0.038713392,-0.035133675,0.027889743,-0.017192526,-0.01773481,0.0051427986,0.0481346,-0.036341466,0.039705824,-0.0006577478,0.02704384,-0.051112246,-0.008415729,-0.05697265,-0.059938654,-0.047208965,-0.023666527,-0.060937434,0.022309547,-0.041435935,0.0033196732,0.017402275,-0.0020075173,-0.011003266,-0.039035026,0.03224539,-0.017522778,0.0057391245,0.030767988,-0.062970094,0.007545614,0.015690915,-0.001926639,-0.027025402,-0.03175782,0.01592339,-0.028924994,0.028261801,-0.04122161,-0.02182195,0.04081281,0.015752453,0.042325955,0.0072933,-0.027206615,-0.060676858,-0.019203097,-0.021529084,0.034576207,0.0068123,0.013376126,-0.022334741,-0.014014424,-0.017056385,0.018367443,0.0049156556,-0.008805125,0.036021926,-0.048183277,-0.043804236,0.029209077,0.0075437617,0.04123686,-0.004370478,0.04563231,0.12379211,0.027958026,0.012564737,-0.050564166,0.031083979,0.004620603,0.013377668,-0.05266246,-0.005979279,-0.036253314],"hash":"eec6f286:1741","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T20:54:27.292Z\n- **User:** entao todo metodo que precisar de xor data independente de qual seja deve chamar um metodo so, nao quero varios metodos espalhados. por exemplo o pacote de C1 de atack normal ja poderia ter chamado esse hhelper direto concorda? e o do c1 de skill chamar ele e logo em seguida fazer oq precisar para o SM. n'ao faze mais sentido? pq vejo que essa regra se encaixa em mais de um lugar...\n- **Outcome:** Concordo — e a boa notícia é que **já funciona exatamente assim**. O helper único já existe: ```cpp // PacketSniffer.cpp:468 — o ÚNICO método XOR do projeto static void GameServerXorData(char* data, int start, int end) { if (start >= end) return; for (int n = start; n < end; ++n) data[n] ^= (data[n - 1] ^ g_XorFilter[n % 32]); } ``` E os dois caminhos já chamam **ele**, sem duplicar a lógica: - `InjectC1Attack` (PacketSniffer.cpp:1687) → `GameServerXorData(buf, 3, len)` → Layer-1 → wire (C1 puro) - `InjectSkillC1` (PacketSniffer.cpp:1711) → `GameServerXorData(buf, 3, 7)` → SM → C3 → Layer-1 → wire Então a regra que você descreveu já está implementada: **um só lugar sabe o XOR**; cada pacote novo só decide o que fazer *depois* (C1 direto ou SM+C3). Não há nenhum outro lugar com a tabela `g_XorFilter` ou o loop encadeado — confirmei por busca, só existe em PacketSniffer.cpp:468-475. **O único ponto fraco:** ele é `static` (visível só dentro de PacketSniffer.cpp). Hoje tudo que injeta está nesse arquivo, então funciona. Mas se um dia outro módulo (ex.: um futuro pacote de movimento no AttackModule) precisar de XOR, ele não consegue chamá-lo. Se quiser, eu exponho no `PacketSniffer.h`: ```cpp namespace PacketSniffer { // XOR encadeado (Camada 2) em [start, end) — a regra única de XorData do jogo void ApplyXorData(uint8_t* data, int start, int end); } ``` Assim qualquer módulo novo faz: `ApplyXorData(buf, 3, len)` e segue com C1 ou SM. Faz essa exposição?\n- **Tools:** search_files","vector":[0.046023704,0.07288801,-0.14414094,-0.07069201,0.03827593,-0.081662714,0.045350857,-0.010081763,-0.08754076,-0.015592242,-0.07079723,-0.030980524,0.07188365,-0.03526799,0.0044871126,-0.031884514,-0.020618098,-0.042849846,-0.04105738,0.044045378,0.022749946,-0.025378544,-0.005250711,-0.032032404,0.074384764,0.019336855,-0.005889747,0.021346988,-0.06366783,-0.027820913,0.042718504,0.02528262,0.024476446,-0.058973152,-0.006707551,-0.049380157,0.054336626,-0.02268271,-0.030302422,-0.0017714375,-0.00528755,-0.040996056,0.016041655,0.0003913103,0.013867151,0.02353078,0.046899762,0.036542073,0.034716837,-0.116693206,0.012294504,0.049750935,0.00092383946,-0.052502964,0.06458587,0.047285963,-0.009809029,0.00450176,0.048024956,-0.048554864,0.07075165,0.00797926,0.028690884,0.05442439,0.019402098,-0.013882895,-0.055037852,0.016816465,-0.054317825,0.023983585,0.065071054,-0.028427105,0.029790634,0.010450202,0.013677259,0.0022358375,-0.013119316,-0.040812638,-0.0071672346,-0.014742865,0.0050967317,-0.0045988164,0.10001784,-0.044335864,0.028284285,-0.008722919,-0.035834327,-0.0024175611,-0.025826836,0.07698633,-0.0013444242,-0.0216186,0.025402889,-0.00077991304,-0.04846136,0.02026986,-0.022371052,0.0059075532,0.03083128,0.0003770391,-0.012911001,0.00041591888,0.050469182,-0.0040870383,-0.009778204,0.04310661,0.0059056715,0.009252321,-0.0131111955,-0.021990327,-0.033149805,-0.009622855,-0.041635912,-0.041903995,0.053428162,-0.02211286,0.044145163,-0.040420786,0.03304855,0.068332635,-0.041233372,-0.03812398,0.024532136,0.058375977,0.063958384,0.025423724,-0.008527116,0.009707674,0.009135692,-0.072721645,0.019712081,-0.013934401,-0.041810293,0.043009594,0.021581747,-0.008106294,0.0022843382,0.0063295583,0.07859204,0.011211693,-0.0036037657,-0.012417,0.01202926,0.00040892346,0.006393349,-0.048927683,0.005979844,-0.042985555,-0.050315093